            <p style="font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#B9C6D2;margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">We operate our own large-capacity water tankers. If your site can't supply water, or can't spare it during production, it doesn't stop the job. Most contractors have to walk away from that call. We don't.</p>
