              <button type="button" data-i="0" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="faq-a" data-click="toggleFaq" style="width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;text-align:left;background:transparent;border:0;padding:18px clamp(16px,2vw,22px);min-height:56px;cursor:pointer;font-family:Oswald,sans-serif;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:clamp(15px,1.5vw,17.5px);line-height:1.25;color:#12171C" class="h0">Are you insured, and can you provide a certificate?<span aria-hidden="true" style="flex:0 0 auto;color:#B5121A;font-size:24px;line-height:1">–</span></button>
            </h3>
            <div id="faq-a" style="display:block;padding:0 clamp(16px,2vw,22px) 20px">
              <p style="font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.68;color:#3B454F;margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">Yes. We carry commercial general liability insurance and maintain WSIB clearance. We provide certificates of insurance and clearance certificates before work begins, and we're familiar with the vendor compliance paperwork most property management firms and industrial facilities require.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #D3D7D9">
            <h3 style="margin:0">
              <button type="button" data-i="1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-b" data-click="toggleFaq" style="width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;text-align:left;background:transparent;border:0;padding:18px clamp(16px,2vw,22px);min-height:56px;cursor:pointer;font-family:Oswald,sans-serif;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:clamp(15px,1.5vw,17.5px);line-height:1.25;color:#12171C" class="h0">Do you work outside of business hours?<span aria-hidden="true" style="flex:0 0 auto;color:#B5121A;font-size:24px;line-height:1">+</span></button>
            </h3>
            <div id="faq-b" style="display:none;padding:0 clamp(16px,2vw,22px) 20px">
              <p style="font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.68;color:#3B454F;margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">Yes. Most of our commercial and industrial work happens at night, on weekends, or during scheduled shutdowns so it doesn't interfere with your operation.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #D3D7D9">
            <h3 style="margin:0">
