            <div id="faq-e" style="display:none;padding:0 clamp(16px,2vw,22px) 20px">
              <p style="font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.68;color:#3B454F;margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">We assess the substrate before we start and match pressure, temperature and method to the material. Aged masonry, coated surfaces and stucco are soft washed at low pressure; durable concrete and metal take full high pressure.</p>
